    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Vitello tonnato relies on gentle "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "poaching",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "poaching"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to keep the veal tender, followed by chilling before slicing so it holds together cleanly. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "tonnato",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tonnato"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " sauce is blended until smooth and spooned generously over each slice. This recipe serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The veal needs to chill for at least 2 hours before slicing, so start the day before if you are serving this for dinner. The sauce can be made up to 24 hours ahead and kept covered in the fridge."
          }
        ]
      },
